=== 1b. THE OTHER REDUCTIONS THE PANEL LOG PROMISES: ICA, KERNEL PCA, t-SNE ===
independent components, ranked by association with the label (training rows):
  IC6  r +0.651  AUC 0.891
  IC1  r +0.331  AUC 0.664
  IC3  r +0.271  AUC 0.654
  IC5  r +0.247  AUC 0.622
  most label-associated IC is IC6; the components are ordered by convergence, not by variance, so no ranking of this list is implied
kernel PCA (rbf, gamma=1/p) on the training rows: 6 components, variance share of the first 0.393
  strongest label association among them: |r| 0.810
  NOTE: an rbf kernel PCA has no exact out-of-sample map (the pre-image problem), so
  it is used here to describe the training rows only and is not scored on the 143.
  1-nearest-neighbour label agreement in 30-d standardised          : 0.955
  1-nearest-neighbour label agreement in t-SNE 2-d (perp 10)        : 0.953
  1-nearest-neighbour label agreement in 30-d standardised          : 0.955
  1-nearest-neighbour label agreement in t-SNE 2-d (perp 30)        : 0.953
  1-nearest-neighbour label agreement in 30-d standardised          : 0.955
  1-nearest-neighbour label agreement in t-SNE 2-d (perp 50)        : 0.960
  (t-SNE distances are not metric, so this compares neighbourhoods, not distances; it is
   reported as a check on what the picture keeps, not as a classifier)

